From: Project Luma <builds@project-luma.local>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 04:30:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] luma: movable shelf islands (ADR-044)

Any shelf island -- the dock, the live and media islands, the
notifications island, the Well, Quick Options and the clock -- can be held
for 400 ms and dragged to any edge or corner, on its own or attached to
another island's group.

The Shelf is now a controller over groups of attached islands, one tracked
chrome actor per group, placed by a pure model (shelfArrangement.js): the
twelve snap zones, free positions, the band solver (24 px between groups,
the dock the only island that shortens), status fusion (the Well, the
control grid and the clock adjacent in one group draw as today's single
island), drop-target resolution, keyboard steps, announcements, one strut
per occupied edge per monitor, and displays (pinned groups fall back to the
primary while their display is absent). The arrangement is the new
shell-state key shelf-arrangement; empty means today's layout, derived from
the v1 keys.

Arrange mode (shelfArrange.js) is entered by a still hold, from the Shelf
menu (right-click an island: Arrange Islands..., Reset Island Layout, Shelf
Settings...) or with Ctrl+Alt+arrow on a focused island. It dims the
desktop, draws group outlines, grips and the empty zones, and a card with
Reset and Done; the attach preview opens a real gap with a caret, the snap
and free previews a ghost footprint. Esc cancels a drag, Ctrl+Z undoes a
drop, and every move is announced to screen readers.

Surfaces open away from their own island's edge; notification cards avoid
every band.
---
diff --git a/data/theme/luma-shelf.css b/data/theme/luma-shelf.css
index d18cbf7..48a966b 100644
--- a/data/theme/luma-shelf.css
+++ b/data/theme/luma-shelf.css
@@ -1842,3 +1842,98 @@ StBoxLayout.luma-notification-tray.luma-surface-dark .luma-notification-tray-cou
   background-color: transparent;
   border-color: transparent;
   box-shadow: none; }
+
+/* ── Movable islands: arrange mode (ADR-044 §10) ─────────────────────────
+ * The scrim dims the desktop under the islands; every group gets a hairline
+ * outline 6px out, every empty zone a dashed placeholder, the active zone and
+ * the attach caret the state fill of ADR-043. Nothing depends on colour
+ * alone: the attach preview is a real gap with a caret, the snap preview a
+ * filled zone plus a ghost footprint, the free preview a ghost and a guide. */
+.luma-arrange-scrim { background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28); }
+.luma-arrange-scrim.luma-arrange-light { background-color: rgba(20, 24, 30, 0.18); }
+
+.luma-arrange-outline {
+  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22); border-radius: 21px; }
+.luma-arrange-light .luma-arrange-outline { border-color: rgba(25, 27, 31, 0.20); }
+.luma-arrange-frost .luma-arrange-outline,
+.luma-arrange-glass .luma-arrange-outline { border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.26); }
+
+.luma-arrange-zone {
+  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22); -luma-line-width: 1px; -luma-dash: 6; border-radius: 15px; }
+.luma-arrange-light .luma-arrange-zone { color: rgba(25, 27, 31, 0.20); }
+.luma-arrange-frost .luma-arrange-zone,
+.luma-arrange-glass .luma-arrange-zone { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.26); }
+.luma-arrange-zone.luma-arrange-zone-active {
+  color: #8a99a8; -luma-line-width: 1.5px; -luma-dash: 0; background-color: rgba(138, 153, 168, 0.18); }
+.luma-arrange-light .luma-arrange-zone.luma-arrange-zone-active {
+  color: #61728a; background-color: rgba(97, 114, 138, 0.18); }
+.luma-arrange-frost .luma-arrange-zone.luma-arrange-zone-active,
+.luma-arrange-glass .luma-arrange-zone.luma-arrange-zone-active {
+  color: #a9b5c1; background-color: rgba(169, 181, 193, 0.18); }
+
+.luma-arrange-ghost { color: #8a99a8; -luma-line-width: 1.5px; -luma-dash: 6; border-radius: 15px; }
+.luma-arrange-light .luma-arrange-ghost { color: #61728a; }
+.luma-arrange-frost .luma-arrange-ghost, .luma-arrange-glass .luma-arrange-ghost { color: #a9b5c1; }
+.luma-arrange-guide { background-color: rgba(138, 153, 168, 0.55); }
+.luma-arrange-light .luma-arrange-guide { background-color: rgba(97, 114, 138, 0.55); }
+.luma-arrange-frost .luma-arrange-guide, .luma-arrange-glass .luma-arrange-guide { background-color: rgba(169, 181, 193, 0.55); }
+
+/* The gap an attach preview opens in a row, and its caret on the seam. */
+.luma-arrange-gap-footprint { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.40); -luma-line-width: 1.5px; -luma-dash: 6; border-radius: 15px; }
+.luma-arrange-gap.luma-arrange-light .luma-arrange-gap-footprint { color: rgba(25, 27, 31, 0.36); }
+.luma-arrange-caret { background-color: #8a99a8; border-radius: 1px; }
+.luma-arrange-gap.luma-arrange-light .luma-arrange-caret { background-color: #61728a; }
+.luma-arrange-gap.luma-arrange-frost .luma-arrange-caret,
+.luma-arrange-gap.luma-arrange-glass .luma-arrange-caret { background-color: #a9b5c1; }
+
+.luma-arrange-grip {
+  border-radius: 3px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55); }
+.luma-arrange-grip:hover, .luma-arrange-grip:active { background-color: #ffffff; }
+.luma-arrange-grip:focus { box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #8a99a8; }
+.luma-arrange-light .luma-arrange-grip { background-color: rgba(25, 27, 31, 0.45); }
+.luma-arrange-light .luma-arrange-grip:hover { background-color: #191b1f; }
+
+/* The lifted island: the deeper far shadow (+50% opacity). */
+.luma-island-lifted .luma-shelf-shadow-far { box-shadow: 0 72px 128px -28px rgba(9, 11, 14, 1); }
+.luma-island-lifted .luma-shelf-shadow-far.luma-surface-light { box-shadow: 0 60px 118px -26px rgba(25, 27, 31, 0.84); }
+.luma-shelf-dragging .luma-shelf-shadow-far { box-shadow: 0 72px 128px -28px rgba(9, 11, 14, 1); }
+
+/* The arrange card: the treatment's menu surface and ink. */
+.luma-arrange-card {
+  font-family: Figtree, sans-serif; width: 340px; padding: 18px 20px 16px; spacing: 4px;
+  border-radius: 14px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
+  background-color: #252a30; color: #e7e9e8;
+  box-shadow: 0 24px 56px -18px rgba(12, 16, 21, 0.68); }
+.luma-arrange-card.luma-surface-light { background-color: #fbfbfa; color: #191b1f; border-color: rgba(39, 48, 56, 0.10); }
+.luma-arrange-card.luma-surface-frost { background-color: rgba(28, 33, 40, 0.88); color: #ffffff; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); }
+.luma-arrange-card.luma-surface-glass { background-color: rgba(14, 19, 26, 0.82); color: #ffffff; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15); }
+.luma-arrange-card-title { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; }
+.luma-arrange-card-body { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; color: rgba(231, 233, 232, 0.72); padding-bottom: 12px; }
+.luma-arrange-card.luma-surface-light .luma-arrange-card-body { color: rgba(25, 27, 31, 0.66); }
+.luma-arrange-card.luma-surface-frost .luma-arrange-card-body,
+.luma-arrange-card.luma-surface-glass .luma-arrange-card-body { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82); }
+.luma-arrange-button {
+  min-height: 28px; padding: 0 22px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 650;
+  background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); color: inherit; }
+.luma-arrange-button:hover { background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.13); }
+.luma-arrange-button:focus { box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #8a99a8; }
+.luma-arrange-button-default { background-color: #8a99a8; color: #15181c; }
+.luma-arrange-button-default:hover { background-color: #9aa8b6; }
+.luma-arrange-card.luma-surface-light .luma-arrange-button { background-color: rgba(35, 39, 45, 0.06); }
+.luma-arrange-card.luma-surface-light .luma-arrange-button:hover { background-color: rgba(35, 39, 45, 0.11); }
+.luma-arrange-card.luma-surface-light .luma-arrange-button-default { background-color: #61728a; color: #ffffff; }
+.luma-arrange-card.luma-surface-frost .luma-arrange-button-default,
+.luma-arrange-card.luma-surface-glass .luma-arrange-button-default { background-color: #a9b5c1; color: #15181c; }
+
+/* The spoken target, shown beside the pointer. */
+.luma-arrange-hint {
+  font-family: Figtree, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 650;
+  padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background-color: rgba(37, 42, 48, 0.94); color: #e7e9e8; }
+.luma-arrange-light .luma-arrange-hint { background-color: rgba(251, 251, 250, 0.96); color: #191b1f; }
+
+/* A clock standing alone is one action: the island washes, not the clock. */
+.luma-shelf-clock-island .luma-status-clock { background-color: transparent; }
+.luma-shelf-clock-button { padding: 0; }
+/* The Shelf menu's rule is a rule, not a 32px row. */
+.luma-shelf-menu .popup-separator-menu-item { min-height: 0; padding: 5px 7px; }
+.luma-arrange-button:insensitive { opacity: 0.45; }
